class_name VmSymbols
extends RefCounted
## Where the pieces the enemy handlers touch live inside each level file of the original: the engine
## services they call (replaced by native code), the variables they read, and the end of the
## per-enemy loop. Generated by tools/vm_symbols.py of the research notes (instruction patterns plus an
## alignment against level 1), checked against the disassembly of every level.
##
## services : entry addresses of the engine routines that are answered natively
## variables: word addresses in the level's RAM image
## rec_size : bytes per enemy record (levels 4 and 5 carry six more bytes), hp_mask: bits of the hit points byte
## aim_guard / aim_scale: whether aimed shots are suppressed at point blank / scaled by the difficulty
## vel_shift: shift applied to the 16.16 velocities of fire_vel / fire_aimed

